# Session start

Run **`/load`** at the start of every session (`.cursor/skills/load/`) — it loads project + z-yap state. **AGENTS.md** is the canonical session contract (start / during / close-out, ZK awareness, rule routing); read it if you skipped `/load`.

Apply these rules to all code you write:

- **coding-style.mdc** — immutable, declarative, recursion, map/reduce, function composition
- **pattern-matching.mdc** — ts-pattern with const pattern objects; no if checks
- **conventions.mdc** — path aliases, pitfalls, tree-sitter, v2
- **agent-behavior.mdc** — collaborative, validate, surface issues, self-maintenance
- **communication.mdc** — prose: density, variation, forward progress
- **testing.mdc** — when touching tests

Do not default to imperative loops or if/else chains. Follow the project's style from the start.
